#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:1
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_AreYouPlanningOnGoingInThere"
msgid ""
"Are you planning on going deep\n"
"in there?\p"
"How about bringing me back some\n"
"SHOAL SALT and SHOAL SHELLS?\p"
"I can make you something good if\n"
"you bring me the ingredients.$"
msgstr ""
"你打算到里面深处去吗？\p"
"能不能帮我带一些\n"
"浅滩海盐和浅滩贝壳回来？\p"
"如果你把材料带给我，\n"
"我可以给你做个好东西。$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:9
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_BringMe4ShoalSaltAndShells"
msgid ""
"If you bring me four each of the\n"
"SHOAL SALT and SHOAL SHELLS,\l"
"I can make you a SHELL BELL…\p"
"You can get those ingredients\n"
"every day.$"
msgstr ""
"如果你把浅滩海盐和浅滩贝壳\n"
"各带4个给我，\l"
"我就可以给你做一个贝壳之铃……\p"
"这些材料\n"
"每天都可以获得。$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:16
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_WouldYouLikeShellBell"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey! SHOAL SALT and SHOAL SHELLS!\n"
"And enough of them, too!\p"
"Would you like me to make you\n"
"a SHELL BELL with them?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，嘿！浅滩海盐和浅滩贝壳！\n"
"而且数量也够了！\p"
"要我用它们\n"
"给你做一个贝壳之铃吗？$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:22
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_MakeShellBellRightAway"
msgid ""
"All righty, then! I'll make you\n"
"a SHELL BELL right away.\p"
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"There! Done!$"
msgstr ""
"好嘞！我马上就给你\n"
"做一个贝壳之铃。\p"
"…… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"好了！做好了！$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:29
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_ExplainShellBell"
msgid ""
"Have a POKéMON hold on to that.\n"
"It'll love it, that's for certain.\p"
"Why, the SHELL BELL's chime…\n"
"It's simply sublime!\p"
"You can get its ingredients every day,\n"
"so I can make you more.$"
msgstr ""
"让宝可梦携带它吧。\n"
"它一定会很喜欢的。\p"
"哎呀，贝壳之铃的铃声……\n"
"简直美妙极了！\p"
"它的材料每天都能获得，\n"
"所以我还可以给你做更多。$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:37
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_WantedToMakeShellBell"
msgid ""
"Oh… Is that so…\n"
"I wanted to make a SHELL BELL…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……是吗……\n"
"我本来想做贝壳之铃的……$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:41
msgctxt "ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_NoSpaceInYourBag"
msgid ""
"You don't have space in your BAG\n"
"if I were to make it for you.\p"
"You should make room and come back\n"
"for a SHELL BELL.$"
msgstr ""
"就算我给你做了，\n"
"你的背包也没有地方放。\p"
"腾出空间之后\n"
"再来拿贝壳之铃吧。$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:47
msgctxt "ShoalCave_Text_WasShoalSaltNowNothing"
msgid ""
"There was some SHOAL SALT here.\n"
"But, there's nothing here now.$"
msgstr ""
"这里曾经有浅滩海盐。\n"
"但是，现在什么都没有了。$"

#: data/text/shoal_cave.inc:51
msgctxt "ShoalCave_Text_WasShoallShellNowNothing"
msgid ""
"There was a SHOAL SHELL here.\n"
"But, there's nothing here now.$"
msgstr ""
"这里曾经有浅滩贝壳。\n"
"但是，现在什么都没有了。$"
